STR8-N BANK MAINT 2.4
␀
BM> ␀NAME [1-8 characters | CLEAR] (YES required)
X bank NAME S NAME / X S NAME bank NAME

BANKS AND MEMORY
  M [1|2|3]                   Grid / ranges (default) / wear
  E bank 8[-F]                Erase sectors
  C src range dst start       Copy RAM or flash
  V src range dst start       Compare RAM or flash

EDITOR BUFFER (4 KiB)
  R src range                 Read into buffer
  D [offset[-end]]            Display buffer
  P offset byte ...           Patch bytes
  F offset[-end] byte         Fill bytes
  N length byte               Create filled buffer
  K                           Buffer CRC16
  W dst start                 Write buffer and verify

CONTROL
  T [bank|first-last]          Stored records
  J bank                      Boot selected bank
  Q                           Return to monitor
  ?                           Show this menu

  src/dst: R = RAM, 0-3 = flash bank. Numbers are hex.
  Flash 8-F = sectors. Editor offsets: 000-FFF.
  Writes: Y to confirm. B2 utilities and B3:8-F protected.
␀INVALID / PROTECTED RANGE
␀CANCELED (completed sectors retained)
␀WRITE/VERIFY FAILED; STOPPED
␀VERIFIED
␀PLAN ␀
